        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Chelsom, Billy Bob Thornton, Jerry Lewis, Simon Fields, Peter Flannery\n- Works: Funny Bones, Max Rose\n- Roles: film director, writer, actor, filmmaker, singer, songwriter, musician, producer, co-producer\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Bob Thornton was born on August 4, 1955, and he is an American actor, filmmaker, singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Peter Chelsom was born on April 20, 1956, and he is a British film director, writer, and actor.\n- Peter Chelsom wrote, directed, and produced the film Funny Bones.\n- Simon Fields co-produced Funny Bones, and Peter Flannery co-wrote Funny Bones.\n- Max Rose was Jerry Lewis's first starring film role since Funny Bones in 1995, and it was his final starring role.",
